        "raw": "[quote=\"Sefirit\"]\n\nThe next time Gloomy had to draw a card it was just going to just be an infinite cycle of Vast Followings doing nothing.&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt wouldn&#39;t really be infinite. Cards don&#39;t go into the trash until their effects are finished, if a effect allows another card play, like Vast Following, it will remain in play until the effect is also completed, and so on. So once all the Vast Following would be played, the last one would try to play a card, since it is an impossible task, it completes and goes into the trash, then the previous one goes to the trash, and so on.\n",
